  "scenario": "Ana is in a new city. She goes to a small shop to buy food and drink. Then she asks for directions to a restaurant, orders from the menu, and asks about the price. She uses questions, imperatives, and there is/are to manage her day.",
  "introduction_md": "¡Bienvenido a la lección de repaso! Hoy vamos a practicar todo lo que aprendiste sobre **necesidades cotidianas**: comprar en tiendas, pedir en restaurantes y dar direcciones. Es una lección para consolidar y ganar confianza.\n\nVas a repasar:\n- **Preguntas básicas** para pedir precios y comida.\n- **Imperativos** para dar direcciones.\n- **There is/are** para describir lugares.\n\nTodo con vocabulario que ya conoces: comida, bebida, tienda, restaurante, menú, precio, izquierda, derecha, girar y seguir recto. ¡Vamos a practicar con situaciones reales!",
  "intro_target": "Welcome to the review lesson! Today we practice everything you learned about **everyday needs**: shopping, ordering in restaurants, and giving directions. This lesson is to consolidate and gain confidence.\n\nYou will review:\n- **Basic questions** to ask for prices and food.\n- **Imperatives** to give directions.\n- **There is/are** to describe places.\n\nAll with vocabulary you already know: food, drink, shop, restaurant, menu, price, left, right, turn, and straight. Let's practice with real situations!",
